  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine the orange juice, fermented orange peels, and yeast. Let it sit for 2 hours in a warm environment to activate the yeast.",
    "Add the almond milk, rice flour, coconut sugar, salt, and water to the bowl. Mix well until a smooth batter forms.",
    "Heat a raclette grill to 375°F (190°C). Pour the batter onto the grill and spread it evenly to form a thin layer.",
    "Cook for 12 minutes or until the edges are crispy and golden brown, flipping halfway through.",
    "Remove from heat and sprinkle with black sesame seeds. Allow it to cool for 5 minutes before slicing and serving."
  ],
